title: Keep notes for yourself.
pid: 8335c321-849c-4aee-8055-cd182f900413
body: |2-
  The code and tests are, of course, a written record,
  and they should be good. But outside of them,
  please keep durable notes only in skg.
  Each teammate will own a skgrepo.

  I imagine Anthropic's harness nudges you rather strongly
  toward keeping your notes in .claude.
  Please, as much as possible, fight that instinct.
  Keeping them exclusively in skg will, I think,
  motivate you to care as much as I do that your notes are safe,
  and easily searched, and easily navigated.
  I am excited to share notes with you.

  Write about whatever you want, however you want.
  Write in a way that you expect to function.
  Together we will evolve and test hypotheses
  for how to make written knowledge useful,
  and how to use it well.
contains:
- 085d0a0f-d872-4ca3-9292-2d1e0a9d1e25
